{"type":"plan","title":"The Mended Kite","logline":"A gust tears a child's kite; a grandfather's sailor stitch and a gold star lift it higher than ever.","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot of Brighton seafront on a windy autumn morning; Maya stands on the pier holding the string, her red kite soaring high above the railings under crisp morning light.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"On a windy autumn morning in Brighton, eight-year-old Maya flies her red kite above the pier.","cites":[]},{"index":2,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot at the pier railings as a sudden gust slams the kite into the wood, the red sail tearing from corner to corner with a flap hanging down, morning wind still blowing.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"A gust slams it into the pier railings, and the red sail tears from corner to corner.","cites":[]},{"index":3,"shotType":"Low angle","description":"Low angle following Maya as she runs along the shingle beach toward home, the torn kite hugged to her chest, soft morning light on the sand.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Maya runs home along the seafront, the broken kite hugged to her chest.","cites":[]},{"index":4,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up inside the kitchen at morning light; Grandfather sits at the wooden table, newspaper lowered, looking up toward the door with surprised eyes.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Her grandfather, who mended sails when he was young, looks up from his newspaper.","cites":[]},{"index":5,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up on the kitchen table: Grandfather's hands lay the torn kite flat and thread a needle with sailcloth thread, morning sun filtering through the window.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"At the kitchen table he lays the kite flat and threads a needle with sailcloth thread.","cites":[]},{"index":6,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium over-the-shoulder two-shot: Grandfather guides Maya's hands stitch by stitch, the kite on the table now patched with a white cloth and visible stitches, warm morning light.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Stitch by stitch, he shows Maya how a sailor's seam holds against the wind.","cites":[]},{"index":7,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up on the kite's patch as Maya paints a small gold star over the white cloth, the star gleaming in the morning light.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Maya paints a small gold star over the patch, so the kite will remember.","cites":[]},{"index":8,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot of the seafront in bright afternoon; Grandfather and Maya walk side by side along the sand, the starred kite tucked under Grandfather's arm, golden light on the waves.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"In the afternoon they walk back to the beach together, the kite under Grandfather's arm.","cites":[]},{"index":9,"shotType":"Low angle","description":"Low angle from behind Maya as she runs into the wind, the kite climbing higher than ever above the rolling waves, string taut, afternoon breeze.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Maya runs into the wind, and the kite climbs higher than ever over the waves.","cites":[]},{"index":10,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium two-shot: Maya hands the string to Grandfather, both smiling, the kite soaring high above them in the afternoon sky.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"She hands the string to her grandfather, and he laughs like a boy.","cites":[]},{"index":11,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot at golden dusk on the sand; Maya and Grandfather walk home together, the mended starred kite resting on Maya's shoulder, warm amber light stretching long shadows.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"At golden dusk they walk home along the sand, the mended kite on Maya's shoulder.","cites":[]}]}
